--   **Context.** KFX §4: the register-driven Lemma 13 core
--
--   The fixed code `l13U q` is `KFL.l13code` with every size-dependent literal read from the
--   *master registers* (`MReg`): `w, 2·M·R` on `1, 6` (for `toBitsU`/`fromBitsU`), the swap flags on
